    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your shipping logistics empire. <br>Flip the first tile.<br>Flip the next tile.<br>Keep going.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572770/extras/bcd58fe470861beb6dadf883d205c365.poster.avif?t=1751028000\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572770/extras/bcd58fe470861beb6dadf883d205c365.webm?t=1751028000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572770/extras/bcd58fe470861beb6dadf883d205c365.mp4?t=1751028000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That tree you just unlocked? It's producing wood.\u00a0<br>Wood gets sent to the port.<br>Port unlocks a new ship.<br>Ship sails to the next port, carrying wood.<br><br>A new factory just opened! <br>Factory prints microchips. <br>Microchips get sent to the port. <br>Ship takes microchip to the next port.<br><br>Three upgrade choices: Quantity of shipments, Active Income or Offline Income.<br>Should you maximize on one path, or average out? <br>Decisions.<br>While you're thinking, keep on flipping.<br> <br>Tiles and more tiles.  <br>Does this ever end?  <br>15 huge maps in this game.  <br>Spend over 10 hours flipping tiles.  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your shipping logistics empire. <br>Flip the first tile.<br>Flip the next tile.<br>Keep going.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572770/extras/bcd58fe470861beb6dadf883d205c365.poster.avif?t=1751028000\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572770/extras/bcd58fe470861beb6dadf883d205c365.webm?t=1751028000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572770/extras/bcd58fe470861beb6dadf883d205c365.mp4?t=1751028000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That tree you just unlocked? It's producing wood.\u00a0<br>Wood gets sent to the port.<br>Port unlocks a new ship.<br>Ship sails to the next port, carrying wood.<br><br>A new factory just opened! <br>Factory prints microchips. <br>Microchips get sent to the port. <br>Ship takes microchip to the next port.<br><br>Three upgrade choices: Quantity of shipments, Active Income or Offline Income.<br>Should you maximize on one path, or average out? <br>Decisions.<br>While you're thinking, keep on flipping.<br> <br>Tiles and more tiles.  <br>Does this ever end?  <br>15 huge maps in this game.  <br>Spend over 10 hours flipping tiles.  </p>",
